# PyTarkBuddy
#
# Read this before adding to it: some binaries here ARE source, not junk.
# Committed on purpose:
#   gui/pytarkbuddy.ico    the window, taskbar and exe icon, generated from the svg beside it
#                          by scripts/make_icon.py, committed so a build never needs cairo
#   docs/assets/**         the images the README links
# Do not add a blanket *.ico rule.

# ---- Python ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
pip-wheel-metadata/
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.tox/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---- Build output ----
build/
dist/
*.spec
*.msi

# ---- Editors and OS ----
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---- Local tool state ----
.claude/

# ---- Not published ----
# docs/ itself stays out; assets is the exception, the README links its images.
docs/*
!docs/assets/
